WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.340
Take a look at this naval ship it's right over&nbsp;
my shoulder. It's a Russian warship here in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:10.200
harbor in Havana. And what's it doing about 90&nbsp;
miles from the United States? Well that may have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.700
to do with the war in Ukraine because Cuba is&nbsp;
one of the few countries that is increasingly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:19.860
defending Russia's invasion of the Ukraine&nbsp;
saying this NATO's fault not Russia's and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:26.880
Russia has responded by sending Cuba oil, food,&nbsp;
even promising to build beachside hotels. Cuban&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.820
officials have said that they would like to&nbsp;
have good relations with the United States,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:35.940
but they they like Russia are under U.S economic&nbsp;
sanctions and meanwhile Russia is coming and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:40.560
offering them this economic assistance.&nbsp;
So really for Cuba it's an easy choice.

